      "summary": "Held batch backlog is growing or at least 10000 units",
      "user_impact": "Recorded audio is accumulating without reaching its owner.",
      "scope": "Fleet-max pre-epoch assignment_held stock: growth below the 10000 count cap, or stock at/above it; fresh samples only.",
      "verification": "Run the exact query in this rule on its declared datasource and compare sample freshness and the replay coverage in the runbook.",
      "safe_next_action": "Inspect assignment/projection recovery and the aggregate batch custody census. At 10000 the bounded count means at least 10000, not measured growth; repair the held leg and drain below the cap without deleting audio.",
